// The intro's story (GAMEPLAY.md's test chain, and others like it): something is wrong in the
// settlement, and a healer is asked. It is drawn anew for each world from the segments of the
// "affliction" theme - questSegments/ - so the start, the middle and the end differ:
//
//   start     the beasts fall sick | a neighbour raves | omens and bad signs
//   middle    a sample from the beasts (a sickness) | signs gathered at the graves (a curse)
//   sickness  ask the maker (or find them dead), herbs, the salve, tried on a beast
//   curse     ask the sexton, a ward, tried on a beast | or find who laid it, and ask them
//
// The test chain - talk, kill and loot, talk, gather, receive, use, talk - is the sickness one.
{
  intro: true,
  draw: { themes: ["affliction"], min: 4, max: 6 },
}
